<view class="native-subpage page gift {{themeClass}}" style="--native-nav-inset:{{navInset}}px;--native-nav-top:{{navTop}}px;--native-nav-row-height:{{navRowHeight}}px;--native-nav-right:{{navRightInset}}px">
  <view class="safe-head"><view class="safe-hbtn" bindtap="back"><native-icon name="back" tone="ink" size="24"></native-icon></view><view class="safe-body"><view class="safe-title-wrap"><text class="safe-title serif">送你一卦</text></view></view><view class="safe-spacer"></view></view>
  <scroll-view scroll-y class="generic-scroll"><view class="pad route-body"><view wx:if="{{disabled}}" class="gf-hero"><text class="gf-ht serif">天命速写卡暂不可用</text><text class="gf-hd">命理速写已暂停。你与军师的战略对话、方案与复盘不受影响。</text></view><block wx:else><view class="gf-hero"><text class="gf-ht serif">给朋友出一张「天命速写卡」</text><text class="gf-hd">命格速写 · 今年大势 · 一条核心建议。生辰只用于本次现场排盘，服务器不保存、不生成公开链接——出的是一张图片，你自己发给朋友。</text></view><view class="pf-q"><text class="pf-qt">1. 朋友怎么称呼</text><input class="pf-input" maxlength="12" placeholder="如：老王" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="pf-q"><text class="pf-qt">2. 出生日期</text><view class="pf-opts"><view class="pf-opt {{calendar==='solar'?'on':''}}" data-field="calendar" data-value="solar" bindtap="select"><text>阳历</text></view><view class="pf-opt {{calendar==='lunar'?'on':''}}" data-field="calendar" data-value="lunar" bindtap="select"><text>阴历</text></view></view><view class="gf-date"><input class="pf-input gf-y" type="number" maxlength="4" placeholder="年" data-field="year" bindinput="input"/><input class="pf-input gf-md" type="number" maxlength="2" placeholder="月" data-field="month" bindinput="input"/><input class="pf-input gf-md" type="number" maxlength="2" placeholder="日" data-field="day" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="pf-q"><text class="pf-qt">3. 时辰（不确定也没关系）</text><view class="pf-opts"><view wx:for="{{shichen}}" wx:key="index" class="pf-opt {{hourIdx===item.index?'on':''}}" data-field="hourIdx" data-value="{{item.index}}" bindtap="select"><text>{{item.label}}</text></view></view></view><view class="pf-q"><text class="pf-qt">4. 性别与出生地</text><view class="pf-opts"><view class="pf-opt {{gender==='male'?'on':''}}" data-field="gender" data-value="male" bindtap="select"><text>男</text></view><view class="pf-opt {{gender==='female'?'on':''}}" data-field="gender" data-value="female" bindtap="select"><text>女</text></view></view><input class="pf-input gf-place" maxlength="20" placeholder="出生城市（选填，用于真太阳时校正）" data-field="place" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="gf-consent" bindtap="toggleConsent"><view class="gf-check {{consent?'checked':''}}"><native-icon wx:if="{{consent}}" name="check" tone="white" size="13"></native-icon></view><text class="gf-consent-t">我已获得对方同意，使用其生辰为其出一张天命速写卡。</text></view><view class="gf-btn {{valid&&!busy?'':'off'}}" bindtap="makeCard"><text>{{busy?'排盘中…':imgPath?'重新出卦':'出卦 · 生成速写卡'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{imgPath}}" class="gf-result"><image class="gf-img" src="{{imgPath}}" mode="widthFix" show-menu-by-longpress></image><view class="gf-acts"><view class="gf-act" bindtap="shareImage"><text>发给朋友</text></view><view class="gf-act ghost" bindtap="saveImage"><text>保存到相册</text></view></view><text class="gf-tip">也可长按上方图片保存或转发。</text></view><canvas canvas-id="fateCanvas" class="gf-canvas" style="width:600px;height:880px"></canvas><text class="gf-note">朋友的生辰只用于本次排盘，服务器不留档、不生成公开链接。命理内容为文化视角的经营参考，不构成决策依据。</text></block><view class="route-bottom-space"></view></view></scroll-view>
  <login-sheet open="{{showLogin}}" reason="profile" bindclose="closeLogin" bindloggedin="loggedIn"></login-sheet>
</view>
